<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.8150 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.8150 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.8150 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.7910 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    February 25	   February 24</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.8150		  1.7910</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $31.31 million	    $27.15 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
